<title>UK: DSL prices $500 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL prices $500 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Nomura said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    13.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.716    PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    99.716    SPREAD	+11 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LX/HK/SI  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 31.JAN.02</p>
<p> NOTES    **US/GB/JP/DE/HK/SI. ALSO RATED AAA BY IBCA.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
